<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL"
                  xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI"
                  xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC"
                  xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI"
                  xmlns:bootstrap.processes="https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap/v0/processes/ns/"
                  xmlns:cat-harness.processes="https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/v0/processes/ns/"
                  id="Definitions_Process_KgSeparationPrepare" targetNamespace="https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/workflows"
                  exporter="folio-assistant" exporterVersion="1">
  <bpmn:import namespace="https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap/v0/processes/ns/" location="https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap/v0/processes/ns.jsonld" importType="http://www.w3.org/ns/json-ld"/>
  <bpmn:resource id="build-pipeline" name="Build pipeline"/>
  <bpmn:resource id="platform-authoring-agent" name="Platform authoring agent"/>
  <bpmn:resource id="publication-manager" name="Publication manager"/>
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collaboration_Process_KgSeparationPrepare">
    <bpmn:participant id="Participant_Process_KgSeparationPrepare" name="Prepare a graph to stand alone" processRef="Process_KgSeparationPrepare"/>
  </bpmn:collaboration>
  <bpmn:process id="Process_KgSeparationPrepare" name="Prepare a graph to stand alone" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>Gets a detangled graph ready to stand alone: its identity, the harness output about it moved to the host, its content split from its tools, its publication planned, and a standalone rehearsal. Each gateway is a command; a check that could not run ends the phase rather than reading as clean. Called by kg-separation (bpmn-authoring: split by phase).</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:extensionElements>
      <cat-harness.processes:policy enforcement="strict"/>
    </bpmn:extensionElements>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="LaneSet_Process_KgSeparationPrepare">
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_Platform" name="Platform authoring agent" partitionElementRef="platform-authoring-agent">
        <bpmn:documentation>The platform-side stages: the graph's identity (version, iriBase, nodeSchemas), moving harness output about it into the host, splitting the content from its tools, and making the parent consume the pair additively.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Start_Prepare</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_Identity</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_Hosted</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_Split</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_Publication" name="Publication manager" partitionElementRef="publication-manager">
        <bpmn:documentation>Owns where things are published: every identifier the content mints must be a file some step publishes, at /&lt;version&gt;/ for programs and /v&lt;major&gt;/ for people; and the first release.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_Plan</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_Pipeline" name="Build pipeline" partitionElementRef="build-pipeline">
        <bpmn:documentation>Runs the checks that decide the gateways: the tools' import closure and the content's lack of code, node identifiers against file paths, the standalone rehearsal, and dereferencing after release. A gate that cannot tell stops the process; it never reads as clean.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>GW_Closed</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>GW_Ids</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_Rehearse</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>GW_Alone</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_Ready</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_RedEdge</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_PrepareUnknown</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_Prepare" name="A detangled, isolated graph">
      <bpmn:outgoing>F1</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_Identity" name="Identity: version,&#10;iriBase, nodeSchemas">
      <bpmn:documentation>The declaration carries name, version, iriBase, needs and nodeSchemas. A base move is `bun run iri:sync -- --from &lt;old base&gt;`, once; then `iri:sync:check` and `check:node-iris` are green.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <bootstrap.processes:skill ref="kg-separation"/>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>F1</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>F2</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_Hosted" name="Move harness output&#10;about it to the host">
      <bpmn:documentation>QA verdicts, translation templates, the exported graph and the glossary ledger are harness output ABOUT the graph: they live with the harness (kgQaHomeFor, translationsHomeFor). The content keeps only what its own checks need; the leak test's pending list is empty. The one exception is a separated layer that declares a `qa` directory of its own with `storage`: its verdicts are its own repository's, published to that repository's qa-reports branch (step 10), and read by a host at the commit it pins.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <bootstrap.processes:skill ref="kg-separation"/>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>F2</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>F3</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_Split" name="Split content&#10;from tools">
      <bpmn:documentation>Create &lt;name&gt;-tools as a sibling directory and move the code: the Zod source, the generators, the README and diagram writers, the content checks. Cut its import cone to its own files and declared packages. Both start at the content's version.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <bootstrap.processes:skill ref="kg-separation"/>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>F3</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>F5</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>F4</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="GW_Closed" name="Tools closed,&#10;content code-free?">
      <bpmn:documentation>Decided by commands, not judgement: `check:tools-closure` (no import leaves the tools directory or names an undeclared package), the content's no-code test, and generated files byte-identical before and after the move. Any failure goes back to the split.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>F4</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>F5</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>F6</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_Plan" name="Plan publication">
      <bpmn:documentation>Every identifier the content mints is a file some step publishes: /v&lt;major&gt;/, for what programs read and pages people read alike; the exact release is the pin's. Name collisions between published files are resolved here.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <bootstrap.processes:skill ref="instance-publication"/>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>F6</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>F8</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>F7</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="GW_Ids" name="Every identifier&#10;its file's path?">
      <bpmn:documentation>Decided by `check:node-iris`: a published node's own identifier ($id or @id) under the release address must be its file's path. A mismatch goes back to the plan: move the file, or change the identifier before it is ever served.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>F7</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>F8</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>F9</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_Rehearse" name="Rehearse standalone">
      <bpmn:documentation>Copy the content and the tools alone into a temporary directory, with nothing else on the path, and run the tools' checks there. An empty tree must exit non-zero, so a rehearsal over nothing cannot pass.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <bootstrap.processes:skill ref="kg-separation"/>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>F9</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>F10</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="GW_Alone" name="Green alone?">
      <bpmn:documentation>Green with nothing else present goes on. Red means an edge the earlier gates did not see, so back to detangling. If the rehearsal could not run, that is not a pass: stop.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>F10</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>F11</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>F12</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>F13</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_Ready" name="Green alone">
      <bpmn:documentation>The graph builds and checks green with nothing of its parent mounted.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>F11</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_RedEdge" name="Red: an unseen&#10;edge">
      <bpmn:documentation>The rehearsal found an edge the measurement missed. The caller goes back to detangling.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>F12</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_PrepareUnknown" name="Could not run">
      <bpmn:documentation>The rehearsal could not run, so nobody can tell. Not clean; the caller stops.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>F13</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="F1" sourceRef="Start_Prepare" targetRef="Task_Identity"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="F2" sourceRef="Task_Identity" targetRef="Task_Hosted"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="F3" sourceRef="Task_Hosted" targetRef="Task_Split"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="F4" sourceRef="Task_Split" targetRef="GW_Closed"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="F5" name="leaks or stale" sourceRef="GW_Closed" targetRef="Task_Split"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="F6" name="closed" sourceRef="GW_Closed" targetRef="Task_Plan"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="F7" sourceRef="Task_Plan" targetRef="GW_Ids"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="F8" name="mismatch" sourceRef="GW_Ids" targetRef="Task_Plan"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="F9" name="every one matches" sourceRef="GW_Ids" targetRef="Task_Rehearse"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="F10" sourceRef="Task_Rehearse" targetRef="GW_Alone"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="F11" name="green" sourceRef="GW_Alone" targetRef="End_Ready"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="F12" name="red: an unseen edge" sourceRef="GW_Alone" targetRef="End_RedEdge"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="F13" name="could not run" sourceRef="GW_Alone" targetRef="End_PrepareUnknown"/>
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="Diagram_Process_KgSeparationPrepare">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="Plane_Process_KgSeparationPrepare" bpmnElement="Collaboration_Process_KgSeparationPrepare">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_Participant_Process_KgSeparationPrepare" bpmnElement="Participant_Process_KgSeparationPrepare" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="130" y="60" width="2030" height="1000"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_Lane_Platform" bpmnElement="Lane_Platform" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="60" width="2000" height="250"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_Lane_Publication" bpmnElement="Lane_Publication" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="310" width="2000" height="250"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_Lane_Pipeline" bpmnElement="Lane_Pipeline" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="560" width="2000" height="500"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_Start_Prepare" bpmnElement="Start_Prepare"><dc:Bounds x="272" y="167" width="36" height="36"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="240" y="209" width="100" height="40"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_Task_Identity" bpmnElement="Task_Identity"><dc:Bounds x="405" y="125" width="120" height="120"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_Task_Hosted" bpmnElement="Task_Hosted"><dc:Bounds x="580" y="125" width="120" height="120"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_Task_Split" bpmnElement="Task_Split"><dc:Bounds x="755" y="125" width="120" height="120"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_GW_Closed" bpmnElement="GW_Closed"><dc:Bounds x="965" y="701.667" width="50" height="50"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="940" y="755.667" width="100" height="53" /></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_Task_Plan" bpmnElement="Task_Plan"><dc:Bounds x="1105" y="375" width="120" height="120"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_GW_Ids" bpmnElement="GW_Ids"><dc:Bounds x="1315" y="701.667" width="50" height="50"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1211" y="755.667" width="100" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_Task_Rehearse" bpmnElement="Task_Rehearse"><dc:Bounds x="1455" y="666.667" width="120" height="120"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_GW_Alone" bpmnElement="GW_Alone"><dc:Bounds x="1665" y="701.667" width="50" height="50"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1697" y="671.667" width="100" height="28"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_End_Ready" bpmnElement="End_Ready"><dc:Bounds x="1847" y="708.667" width="36" height="36"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1815" y="750.667" width="100" height="40"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_End_RedEdge" bpmnElement="End_RedEdge"><dc:Bounds x="1847" y="875.333" width="36" height="36"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1815" y="917.333" width="100" height="40"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_End_PrepareUnknown" bpmnElement="End_PrepareUnknown"><dc:Bounds x="1497" y="875.333" width="36" height="36"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1465" y="917.333" width="100" height="40"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Edge_F1" bpmnElement="F1"><di:waypoint x="308" y="185"/><di:waypoint x="405" y="185"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Edge_F2" bpmnElement="F2"><di:waypoint x="525" y="185"/><di:waypoint x="580" y="185"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Edge_F3" bpmnElement="F3"><di:waypoint x="700" y="185"/><di:waypoint x="755" y="185"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Edge_F4" bpmnElement="F4"><di:waypoint x="875" y="185"/><di:waypoint x="940" y="185"/><di:waypoint x="940" y="726.667"/><di:waypoint x="965" y="726.667"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Edge_F5" bpmnElement="F5"><di:waypoint x="990" y="701.667"/><di:waypoint x="990" y="82.2222"/><di:waypoint x="815" y="82.2222"/><di:waypoint x="815" y="125"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="994" y="354.444" width="88.38" height="17" /></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Edge_F6" bpmnElement="F6"><di:waypoint x="1015" y="726.667"/><di:waypoint x="1080" y="726.667"/><di:waypoint x="1080" y="435"/><di:waypoint x="1105" y="435"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="996" y="410" width="80" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
